{"4606560": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Finding Frankie 2", "steam_appid": 4606560, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4606560/extras/95b05930d864dcd48f900faa531336cc.avif?t=1780779049\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4606560/extras_big/95b05930d864dcd48f900faa531336cc.webp?t=1780779049 width=1560 height=878 /></span><br><i>Dragged into a deadly televised parkour game show, you must survive brutal challenges for a shot at the grand prize. Run, grind, vault, and fight to win or die trying. Blending high-speed parkour with horror, turning every wall run, rail grind, and jump into a fight to survive.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Parkour for Your Life</strong><br><i>Wall run, slide, swing, jump, and rail grind through Frankie’s deadliest challenges yet. Master every move, because Frankie, Henry Hotline, and the rest of his twisted cast are always hunting you.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rail Grinding</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4606560/extras/52474925f6533cc603f397d3546cc632.avif?t=1780779049\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4606560/extras_big/52474925f6533cc603f397d3546cc632.webp?t=1780779049 width=1560 height=361 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wall Running</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4606560/extras/a876015bd742c23cb33e3e29b91c8780.avif?t=1780779049\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4606560/extras_big/a876015bd742c23cb33e3e29b91c8780.webp?t=1780779049 width=1560 height=361 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vaulting</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4606560/extras/caaf0dca245c388a96c13cb6e1726d53.avif?t=1780779049\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4606560/extras_big/caaf0dca245c388a96c13cb6e1726d53.webp?t=1780779049 width=1560 height=361 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grappling</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And more...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Conquer the Parkour Complex</strong><br>Explore Frankie’s Parkour Complex, a massive five-story tower built for chaos. Capture flags, conquer each floor, and push deeper into the madness as the competition grows more dangerous.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive the Show</strong><br>Fight to stay in the game, outplay the other contestants, and survive long enough to win it all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4606560/extras/95b05930d864dcd48f900faa531336cc.avif?t=1780779049\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4606560/extras_big/95b05930d864dcd48f